OL,4,CMercury visitor arrives              W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GAfter an eight-year journey          W5
OL,7,Gtravelling almost six billion miles  W5
OL,8,G(10bn km), a spacecraft called       W5
OL,9,GBepiColombo is about to reach its    W5
OL,10,Gfinal destination and get into orbit W5
OL,11,Garound Mercury.                      W5
OL,12,                                      W5
OL,13,GIt will be entering an extremely     W5
OL,14,Ghostile environment: Mercury is the  W5
OL,15,Gclosest planet to the Sun and        W5
OL,16,Gtemperatures can reach a fierce 430C W5
OL,17,Gand then plunge to -180C, and it is  W5
OL,18,Gconstantly blasted with intense      W5
OL,19,Gsolar radiation.                     W5
